<section id="A9" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix I </span>Literature Graph Size</h2>

<div id="A9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this appendix, we report the training loss curves in Fig. <a href="#A5.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ Appendix E Datasets Preparation ‣ LitBench: A Graph-Centric Large Language Model Benchmarking Tool For Literature Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> from our ablation study investigating the impact of literature graph size, as discussed in Section <a href="#S4.SS4" title="4.4. Ablation Studies ‣ 4. Benchmarking and Evaluation ‣ LitBench: A Graph-Centric Large Language Model Benchmarking Tool For Literature Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
